// std/opencl_loader.zag — public OpenCL compatibility runtime.
//
// The implementation lives in opencl_runtime.zag so the loader name remains
// stable for existing programs while the executable adapter stays easy to
// audit.  It is a bounded OpenCL path: GPU discovery, context/queue creation,
// SPIR-V-IL upload with OpenCL-C fallback, one-dimensional dispatch, checked
// readback, and deterministic cleanup.  The C ABI is intentionally scalar;
// callers pass raw C-compatible pointers and own their source/output buffers.
@import("opencl_runtime.zag")
